Fusion, and even Looker.

00:05:04.590 --> 00:05:07.020
And actually, the vast
majority of BigQuery customers

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:09.110
are using a number
of these services

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:11.670
together with BigQuery.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:13.410
And Sky UK is one of them.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.660
Of course, Sky is a broadcaster.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:19.530
And they provide
these enhanced set

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:24.720
top boxes that communicate data
directly to Pub/Sub, Dataflow,

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:28.050
and BigQuery for
real time analysis.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:31.740
What that enables Sky to
do is to really understand

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:33.790
the customer deeply.

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:37.050
They're able to visualize
what customers are doing,

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:39.810
what they're watching,
their preferences.

00:05:39.810 --> 00:05:45.120
They're able to tailor
customized content

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:47.260
and advertisements,
so on and so forth.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:52.950
And they even can do research on
customers by doing A/B testing.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:55.500
SUDHIR HASBE: And if you look
