00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:12.690
We have HSBC.

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:13.400
We have Sky.

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:14.140
We have King.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:16.620
We have various
different customers--

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:19.310
Metro, Ocado, and EMEA.

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:21.350
We also have customers
