00:34:47.929 --> 00:34:50.020
And finally, we are
the leaders in all

00:34:50.020 --> 00:34:53.034
the different magic
quadrants from Gartner,

00:34:53.034 --> 00:34:55.659
as well as Forrester [INAUDIBLE]
over the last couple of years.

00:34:55.659 --> 00:34:56.980
This is one example.

00:34:56.980 --> 00:35:00.670
But one of the things I want
to close today by telling you

